- * The fallback: while L1 and R1 are both held on a pad without motion sensors, the right stick's X tilts the pad,
- *     X = 512 + 113 * tan(36 deg * s),  s = right stick X in [-1, 1],  Y = 399 (1 g), Z = 512, G = 512,
